OL,3,GNEWSAThe hidden daytime dance
OL,4,Arevolution - and the man who captured
OL,5,Ait on camera
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor decades, photographer Tim Smith's
OL,8,Fimages of Bradford's British Asian
OL,9,F"daytimers" dance scene remained
OL,10,Flargely unseen. Now, some of those
OL,11,Fshots are taking their place in a major
OL,12,FTate exhibition examining the
OL,13,Fcreativity and rebellion that
OL,14,Ftransformed 1990s Britain.
OL,16,FOn a bright afternoon in Bradford,
OL,17,Fshoppers moved through the city centre
OL,18,Fcarrying bags, going about their day.
OL,20,FBehind a nearby doorway, another side
OL,21,Fof Bradford was pulsing to a very
OL,22,Fdifferent rhythm.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
